WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.150
Someone once said:

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.720
There are rainbows whose 
bases shed sweet, sugary,

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.430
seven-flavored clouds of cotton candy...

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:58.360
The floating Candyclouds!

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.900
There is a bread peak which sees 
the first light of the morning sun,

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:05.300
Mt. Croissant!

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.710
There is a tree, basking 
in the sparkling sun,

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.680
that seeps sap of succulent potage...

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.810
The Corn Potage Tree!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:16.780
There is an island on which is 
assembled a full breakfast menu,

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.080
with Ham n' Eggrass whose pods open 
underneath the morning light...

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.920
The Breakfast Isle!

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.860
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.860
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:35.770
Toriko, Coco, and Komatsu 
captured the Puffer Whale,

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:39.770
and then felt an evil aura closing 
in from deep underneath the ocean...

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:49.280
The Strongest Wolf that Ever 
Lived! The Battle Wolf is Reborn!

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.560
That's...

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.260
Tina-san!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.530
Are you okay?

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.290
I-I'm okay...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.460
But...

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.770
The robbers and killers who 
were after the Puffer Whale...

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:10.600
Yeah... They must have been attacked

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.640
when they tried to steal 
that thing's Puffer Whales.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.010
My god...

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.750
Kiss!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.450
Came to pick me up?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.620
This is... an Emperor Crow?

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.360
Rescue has arrived!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.390
Well, I'll be taking my leave then.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.430
I prefer to avoid crowds.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.030
Komatsu-kun, thank you.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.570
I'm glad that we met.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.140
And I learned a lot from you!

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:47.640
Thank you very much!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.110
Later, Toriko...

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.440
Although I feel like it will not be long...

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.410
Yes, that might be so.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.680
I refuse to accept this even 1 gram, Chief!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.190
Why am I being suspended?

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.690
Look... What did you think you were doing?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.190
Sneaking into an IGO Biotope...

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.730
Going out filming a story on the 
Puffer Whale without permission...

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.130
You think we, as a company, can allow that?

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.630
And besides,

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:16.570
"A mysterious creature appeared!"

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:17.940
What the heck is with that?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.570
This conversation is not filling me up!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.710
A hairy anteater thing blew 
away all those robbers!

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:24.210
Do you have proof?!

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.440
Well...

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.050
Uh...

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:30.650
All you have are receipts for food!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:33.320
There's no way the company's 
gonna pick up the tab for that!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.590
And... Your camera and PC?

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.090
I think I lost them...

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.760
Write a letter of apology!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:44.030
And what is the current damage to the IGO,

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.800
Management Chief Wyne?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.830
Sir. Biotope numbers 4, 5, and 8...

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.940
The damage to Biotope #8 
was especially severe.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.940
All the Rainbow Fruit have been stolen.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.310
And the Troll Kongs have 
been all but wiped out.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.480
Management Chief...

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.280
I have a report from the 
Legal Affairs Bureau...

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.850
This is the PC and camera we 
confiscated from the press

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:05.750
in front of the Puffer Whale cave.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.420
We have just now recovered the hard disk

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:10.890
and verified the video data it contained.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.860
A new model GT Robot...

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:14.460
Correct.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.530
It is likely that it attacked 
the Biotopes as well.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.800
They are finally making their move!

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.370
Do we, the IGO, have no 
other choice than to send

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.900
the Four Heavenly Kings, Toriko, 
Coco, Sunny, and Zebra?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.610
You're going to release Zebra?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.810
Do we have any other choice?

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.910
If this is what we're up against...

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.680
As you wish.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.950
I anticipated that is how you would think.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.720
I have already called for Toriko.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.920
Devil Python hamburger patties,

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.190
layered with slices of Neo 
Tomatoes and Mineral Cheese!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.760
I call it the Toriko Burger!

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.730
It's too big!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.930
I give thanks for all this world's bounty!

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.570
Now let's eat!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.270
He ate it by separating his jaw!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.970
Tastes strong, but it's pretty spongy...

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.740
You can really sink your 
teeth into this meat.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:05.210
The Neo Tomato tastes fresh and invigorating.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.780
The mellow flavor of the Mineral 
Cheese soothes my heart.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:10.180
The trio of flavors strums 
a scrumptious chord!

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.420
Yummy!

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:14.650
By the way, how was the Puffer Whale?

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.220
It had real impact, but I think 
I'm gonna give it a pass.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.890
There's still tons of creatures in the 
vast oceans that I haven't eaten yet.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:24.730
I can't decide the Fish 
for my Course so simply.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.800
I see.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:30.070
However, the creature we, the IGO, have 
requested that you capture this time...

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:33.170
The Regal Mammoth!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.110
Somewhere inside its body,

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:40.180
combining the deliciousness of shoulder, 
tenderloin, giblets, sirloin...

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.980
All seven cuts of meat into one...

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.380
A cut like a precious stone...

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.820
They say there is something 
called Jewel Meat!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.620
I have high expectations!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.790
This is going to be great, Toriko-san!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.390
Do you really get it, Komatsu?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.560
The Regal Mammoth is in Biotope #1.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.530
Right! It's that famous island

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.730
where they do all the Gourmet 
Research, and they give tours.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.500
The island which gives rise to new 
tastes... Nicknamed the "Gourmet Garden".

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.570
That's the face the public sees.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.240
The face that the public...?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:12.540
The largest IGO Garden... Biotope #1 is 
an island of 500,000 square kilometers.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.980
A single, large island.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:16.180
The area for tourists 
is just a tiny fraction.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.280
Even the IGO hasn't explored 
the entire island.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:22.650
The island is surrounded 
by tall mountain peaks,

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:26.420
and creatures from selective 
breeding and cloning roam freely,

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.760
which have caused it to 
develop its own ecosystem.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.730
I bet we're in for another 
extremely tough trip, aren't we?

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:33.970
You'd better be prepared, Komatsu.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.470
Argh! I'm so angry I could eat a horse!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:42.140
The Chief's so hardheaded!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.940
Can you even believe it?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.380
I raise the news carrier balloon pigeons.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.480
I don't really know much about your job.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:53.950
Here they come!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:08:00.460
Everyone's come back carrying Gourmet 
scoops for the evening news!

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:06.230
There, there...

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:11.770
A video of the alcohol that gushes out 
from the Chestnut Peaks, Mont Brandy!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.200
That's amazing!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.910
I think we'll show it on the 
evening news right away!

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.080
It's a huge scoop!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.180
When sending Gourmet scoops from places

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.380
where even electromagnetic waves can't reach,

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:29.490
the reporters send the video data 
with these carrier balloon pigeons.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.990
Then these little guys carry 
them with all they got.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.130
Isn't it nice?

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.960
I don't know much about your job,

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:39.730
but this much I do know.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:44.640
Kuruppo has really taken a liking to 
you, and you can't let him stay idle.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.780
Oh? Back already?

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:55.980
Is the report from the meeting of 
the heads of state over already?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.480
It's been canceled.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:01.290
All the heads of state have rushed 
to an inspection at Biotope #1...

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.820
Cancel the summit for an inspection?

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.360
Strange things do happen...

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.660
Something's fishy...

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:08.660
Kuruppo!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.060
Aren't you suspended?

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.470
Run, young one!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:19.640
We are now heading into 
Biotope #1, the Garden.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.910
Wow... This is amazing.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.610
Don't go getting lost now.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:24.210
Right!

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.990
This is the Gourmet Research Facility?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:41.230
30% of the world's Gourmet 
ingredients can be produced here.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.290
W-Wow!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.230
There are ingredients here I've never seen!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.700
In the vast Garden, we are constantly 
using selective breeding.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.670
As well as research that 
can't be made public...

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.470
You're still doing that?

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:52.870
Yes...

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:55.570
Damn those rich bastards and 
their twisted hobbies...

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.780
The Chief is in the basement.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.480
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.050
What's this Chief person like?

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.950
He's just a boozed-up old man.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:12.120
Well, he is considered the No. 3 after 
the President and Vice President.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:15.230
No. 3? Now I'm nervous...

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.000
Keep that nervousness handy.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.230
You never know what might 
jump out to attack you.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.540
Calm down, Komatsu.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.510
As long as we have these specially 
strengthened acrylic cages, we're fine.

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:33.040
That was a shock...

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.910
Wait... What is this place?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.750
These living creatures are...?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:42.950
Clones of extinct species, and new 
species made by crossbreeding others...

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.260
Chain Animals.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.490
Chain Animals?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.690
Creatures in captivity.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.130
They hold out that Gourmet 
research is a noble endeavor,

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:55.700
but from an ethical standpoint, 
this place is top-secret.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:59.300
So that's why it's filled with 
creatures I've never seen before...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:03.510
Even so, this acrylic is so clear, it's 
almost like there's nothing there...

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.210
There really isn't!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:08.580
Muscle Crab (Mammalian Beast 
Crustacean Hybrid) Capture Level 3

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:11.480
Komatsu!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.790
The Muscle Crab has escaped!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.190
Help me!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.990
Go back to bed!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.560
I said, go back to bed.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.910
I told you not to keep your eyes off it!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.610
I-I'm very sorry!

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.940
Goddamn... They're all like this...

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.850
Already drinking, Chief Mansom?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.250
Did you just call me handsome?

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.280
No, I didn't!

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.320
This is the Chief?

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.650
Whoa, he smells like alcohol!

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.920
Welcome! Or should I say, welcome back!

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.530
Welcome back?

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.530
So, what is it this time?

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.960
You didn't call me here just 
for the Regal Mammoth, right?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.670
The Gourmet Corp. has 
started to make its move.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:03.200
The Gourmet Corp.?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.110
Thanks to the new model GT Robot,

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:10.580
our Gourmet Corp. has been collecting 
one ingredient after another,

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.110
Vice Head Chef.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.650
It is not yet enough.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.310
We are already moving on to the next plan.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.580
We will obtain it shortly...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.090
The Regal Mammoth!

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.930
Now I understand...

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:36.530
That thing we saw in the Puffer Whale 
cave was from the Gourmet Corp.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.900
It was probably a new model GT Robot.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.910
Um... What's the Gourmet Corp.?

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.310
It's an organization that's 
trying to take control

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.580
of all ingredients in the Gourmet Age.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:49.680
They will go to any lengths 
to obtain ingredients.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.550
The next target of the Gourmet Corp. 
is most likely the Regal Mammoth.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:59.720
So we have to capture 
it before they do, then?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.960
What's that cheering?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.660
I forgot about the main event!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.140
It's still the undercard! We made it in time!

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.650
What is this place?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.110
The Gourmet Colosseum.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.980
It's an arena where we can measure beasts' 
fighting ability and capture level.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.020
But it's really a place to 
entertain the rich, powerful,

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:32.590
and VIPs from all the 
member nations of the IGO.

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:35.260
I thought I'd seen some 
of the spectators before!

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:38.200
Yes... They're the heads of state 
for nations around the world!

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:42.530
Betting takes place here,

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.100
and each day, wealth nearing that 
of an entire nation changes hands.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.510
The battles here are stimulating 
enough to attract the leaders

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.240
associated with the IGO to come watch.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.110
I need the organization myself.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:56.280
Through the battles, we squeeze 
the rich for all they're worth,

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:59.150
then spread the wealth around to poor 
countries suffering from starvation.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.420
You mean you make donations?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.820
The IGO, which was once part of the UN,

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.490
went independent due to the 
demand for Gourmet ingredients.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.430
It is now an international organization 
with more than 360 member countries!

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.970
Winner, Troll Kong!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.240
It's not so easy to fill the gap

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.810
between the wealth of so 
many different countries.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:25.610
So we take drastic measures like this.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.510
I really have no interest in these battles.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.850
Don't say that!

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.480
We've got a main event crazy enough

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.020
for all the heads of state 
to blow off their summit!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.490
Gourmet TV again?

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:41.430
Where in the world did you get in?

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:42.790
I used the main entrance!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.600
There's no way you did!

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:48.270
Only VIPs can enter! This is 
a completely secret Colosseum!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.540
S-Shoot, she escaped!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.310
What's with this extra-helping of excitement?

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.180
Continuing with today's main event!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:07.350
Let's welcome the beast contenders!

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:08.950
It's started!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.760
First, emerging from gate #1...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.890
The rampaging behemoth of 
the northern continent...

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:17.330
Elephantsaurus (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 17

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.060
Elephantsaurus!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.860
From gate #2...

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.200
Growlrus (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 13

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.870
The amphibious devil...

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.170
Growlrus!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.470
Oh, here comes da Boss!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.340
From gate #3...

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:29.610
Silverback!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:30.340
Silverback (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 10

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:33.850
From gate #4, the god of death, 
descending from the skies...

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:36.610
Gerolud (Avian Beast) Capture Level 15

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.180
Gerolud!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.190
W-Whoa!

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.120
It's too early to be shocked.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:47.630
Today's main stars are legendary 
beasts behind gates #5 and #6!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.160
Thanks for waiting!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:53.060
From gate #5 comes the strongest 
wolf that ever lived,

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.230
reborn from ancient times!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.840
Battle Wolf!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.970
Wow!

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:05.380
A Battle Wolf, from the "Death Gore Tragedy"!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.110
Battle Wolf?

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.180
The legend of the Battle Wolf...

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.380
The Death Gore Tragedy.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:17.320
In the distant past, a devil 
was born into this world.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.490
With a height of 50 meters, 
and weighing 1000 tons,

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.560
it was a super giant herbivore, 
called the Death Gore.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:28.830
They were devils who would consume 
all plants in great lines,

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.240
destroying the land...

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.240
All that was left in their 
wake was a dead world.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.310
Indeed, each step the Death Gores made

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.040
was a countdown to the 
extinction of all life.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.880
They consumed an entire continent,

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:46.480
then proceeded to the largest continent 
in the world, a green paradise.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:51.060
But they weren't able to devour even 
one blade of grass of that paradise...

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.290
The devils were hunted to 
extinction by a single creature,

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:59.060
who claimed that paradise as its domain.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:02.330
By the Battle Wolf!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.670
From gate #5, a legend stalks again!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.140
The strongest wolf to ever live!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.450
The King of the Land, born in ancient times!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:27.130
I present to you, Battle Wolf!

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:31.130
Battle Wolf (Mammalian Beast) 
Capture Level Immeasurable

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:34.370
The legendary wolf... Battle Wolf!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.030
What an incredible presence!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.970
Legendary wolf?

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:41.010
Yeah... My goosebumps won't go away!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:50.750
Battle Wolf? This is one 
super-sized incredible scoop!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.120
We found a few cells from a Battle Wolf

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.620
in the area where the Death 
Gores were wiped out.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.890
This one is a clone created from those cells.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.590
Height of 18 meters, and a weight of 11 tons.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:06.060
Their ecology is still shrouded in mystery,

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:09.130
but it may be as large 
as Battle Wolves can get.

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:13.970
Well, one thing we know is that the blood 
of the ancient King runs through it.

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.710
Take a look at the rest of them.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:21.480
Everyone's so scared they can't move!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.720
The most popular is Battle Wolf.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:28.190
And the second is the legendary 
beast, Demon Devil Python!

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:30.190
I-Is that...?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.220
The same species that attacked 
you in the cave, Komatsu.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.200
Oh, is that you, Rin?

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:40.430
Perfect timing. Where's 
the Demon Devil Python?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.100
Now's not the time, Baldy!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:42.970
What?!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:43.740
Did you say "handsome"?

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.500
I didn't say "handsome"!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.140
Anyway, my Battle Fragrance 
Machine is broken!

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.980
At this rate, the beasts are 
gonna be so super max hyped-up,

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.410
they'll go on a rampage!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:56.110
Seriously? You're a Beast Master!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.850
Can't you do something?

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.820
I'm doing something, but I can't stop it!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.790
And stop working me to the bone, Baldy!

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.490
What? Handsome?

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.990
I didn't say that.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.360
Toriko, this might get ugly...

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.630
I heard her.

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:09.830
T-Toriko?!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.200
Are you there?

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.760
What'll I ever do?!

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:17.200
I'm like, max happy!

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:27.110
A great deal of Battle Fragrance!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:29.350
What's Battle Fragrance?

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:33.150
It's an extract from a Battle Flower 
which blooms on Battle Island,

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.850
where the fighting never ends.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:38.690
It works on Beasts' central nervous system,

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.830
and causes them to go into a rage.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:45.460
The Beast Master Rin uses 
it as a form of control.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.930
Well, it's needed for the Colosseum,

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.570
but this amount spells trouble.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.640
It's stimulating their nervous 
systems to an extreme!

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:17.630
It's acting strangely...

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:23.100
Is it a female?

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.770
Y-Yes, it is...

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:25.640
And?

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:37.550
Everyone's in a craze since the 
top seed's getting beaten, right?!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.920
T-Toriko-san?

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:43.790
Two-Fold...

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.490
Spiked Punch!

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.630
Sorry 'bout this.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.700
Behave yourself for a little while.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.030
Toriko-san's inside the arena!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.970
That idiot!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:20:58.640
It's Toriko!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:00.410
The Gourmet Hunter Toriko has busted in!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:04.510
Wait... Why is Toriko here?

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:08.750
It's been a while since I've stood here.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:10.950
For real?

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.020
Toriko!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:28.070
How're you doing, Your Legendary Majesty?

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:50.190
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:56.460
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:03.670
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:08.640
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:13.710
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:17.080
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:21.550
on a journey with no end!

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:26.560
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.660
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:35.700
amid the waves of time.

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:40.040
Gourmet News!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.170
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:45.910
Today we'll be introducing 
to you the Toriko Burger!

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:50.050
When a leading burger chain started 
selling the "Charisma Toriko Burger",

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.450
since it only uses extremely 
high quality ingredients,

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:54.020
it went deep into the red,

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:56.120
and sales were stopped!

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.790
And whoa, it's huge!

00:22:58.320 --> 00:23:01.360
If I go now, maybe they'll 
still have a few left...

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.430
And now, the next story!

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.220
Toriko enters the fray!

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:10.800
And with 1.1 odds, he's heavily favored to win!

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:14.270
But, now we have more interference from outside! Who is that guy...?!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:17.480
The Threat Appears! Rumble 
at the Gourmet Coliseum!

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:19.450
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
